OL,3,GNEWSAThe childhood promise that brought
OL,4,Aprofessional ballet to a
OL,5,Apost-industrial town
OL,6,
OL,7,FDarius James remembers sitting before
OL,8,FGwent County Council at 10 years old
OL,9,Fand being asked the question: "Why
OL,10,Fshould we give you money?"
OL,12,FHe had earned a place at the Royal
OL,13,FBallet School, but his parents could
OL,14,Fnot afford the school fees.
OL,16,FIn response, he told the council he
OL,17,Fwould go away and develop his skills
OL,18,Fand use them to help his community in
OL,19,FNewport.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
