OL,3,GNEWSAThe childhood promise that brought
OL,4,Aprofessional ballet to a
OL,5,Apost-industrial town
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs James' Newport-based dance company
OL,8,FBallet Cymru marks its 40th
OL,9,Fanniversary, he hopes he has fulfilled
OL,10,Fthat promise.
